Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:12.00,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1850,0)}Love is the best teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:12.00,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\pos(575,250)}Pliny the Younger, "Epistulae"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:19.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You brought the newest issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:24.22,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd love to hear your thoughts on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.26,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You've already read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:29.65,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,They've all been so good, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:34.38,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Once you finish it, feel free \Nto return it to the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:38.05,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm sorry to be blunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:42.15,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,but are you the one who changed Ryuen-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:47.91,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I just put the puzzle pieces together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:53.14,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to be so forward with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:57.92,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I know you don't like to \Ntalk about things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:03.31,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,If I lost a friend with similar \Ninterests over something like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:04.92,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I'd really regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:10.18,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,But I thought that if I didn't take that \Nstep, we might not make any progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.42,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.84,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:17.43,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I don't even know what I'm trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:24.07,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Um, did you hear how our \NClass D fought in the final exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:27.32,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't condemn your method, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:33.55,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,But a plan that could get your \Nopponent hurt is clearly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:36.71,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you knew that, why didn't you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:40.71,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,You really think he'd listen \Nto what I have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:48.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Would you take a message \Nto Ryuen for me, Hiyori?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:50.97,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:50.97,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&HA28E8A&\bord0\shad0\frx8\fry2\frz12.09\fay.09\pos(256,256.666)}I'd like to talk to you.\N Can you come now?\N I'll be waiting at Café Pallet in Keyaki Mall.\N\NLet me know if you can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.65,0:01:55.40,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,"Come now"? What in the world does he want?
