Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:39.86,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:41.78,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.61,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sit, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:48.62,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,If people see us having tea together, \Nwon't they spread weird rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.12,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Were you with someone just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:57.62,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:03:58.73,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hiyo—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:03.88,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We both like reading, so we talk a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:07.53,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Oh? You use her given name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.98,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,And you've got stuff in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:12.64,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:19.42,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Look, I don't care who you're friends with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.40,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What did you {\i1}want{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:24.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:26.66,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What?! What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:29.78,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll email you again if I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:32.51,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:33.79,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:42.03,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Meeting up in the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.53,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Very tasteful of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:46.98,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I heard how you shone during the final exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:49.51,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Can I assume you're back in business, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:53.14,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Who can say? Maybe it was just a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:57.27,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,So? What do you intend to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:01.92,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Don't think you can win by \Ngoing around as a double agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.53,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You damn snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:06.53,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Double{\i0} agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:11.28,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm not content to \Nbe in with just two classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:14.29,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Kanzaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:18.54,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,He was just begging for an audience with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:22.53,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,And in return, you get an in with Class B?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:25.42,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Did you really think \NKanzaki would go for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.17,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Oh, he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.18,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.42,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Hashimoto, I don't trust you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.18,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,But I do believe I can use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:37.56,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:42.69,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,So? Here to describe to \Nme the taste of defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:49.45,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Just so you know, the dirty tricks you \Nused won't work on Class B again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:53.45,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Please. You're just Ichinose's bootlicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:54.94,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,What do you expect to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:59.65,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,It's true that I've spent this \Nyear as Ichinose's supporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:03.21,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,But if Ichinose can't bring \Nherself to do what's necessary...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:08.85,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,I'll take my own approach to \Nfighting an enemy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.67,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:18.73,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:20.43,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:23.98,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I thought up the perfect \Nway to get to Class A!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:27.10,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You should join our class!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:30.39,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:33.87,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,If Ryuen-san and Ayanokoji teamed \Nup, they'd be unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:37.38,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi and Ichinose \Nwould be a breeze to beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.50,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd certainly give you my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.43,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Hey... Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:43.62,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,See? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.75,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,We'd love to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But it can't really happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:51.76,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Where would you get the twenty million \Npoints needed for me to change classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:57.21,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Besides, it's more fun to have \Nhim as an enemy than as an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:01.77,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You and Ryuen are both weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:04.39,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:15.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold just standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.36,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:22.79,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You can be rather forceful, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:26.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You seemed like you didn't \Nwant to go back to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:32.80,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It seems like you're always \Nthere when I'm feeling low.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:37.18,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Feel free to share your \Ntroubles with me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:38.78,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:42.56,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I've already relied on you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:45.69,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,To impose on you any longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.50,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It would just be too pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:51.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You don't trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:52.69,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It isn't that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:58.94,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think I trust you more \Nthan anyone else right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:01.70,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Even though I'm an \Nenemy from another class?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.86,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I don't like to throw \Naround the word "enemy."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:06.55,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You might not be my ally,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:09.90,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,but I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:18.45,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Talking to Horikita-san \Nearlier made it clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:21.97,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,She's grown so much in this past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:25.17,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Same with Ryuen-kun and Sakayanagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:29.37,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,The other class leaders are \Ngetting stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:34.03,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll be able to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:36.11,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:38.40,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Where will I be in a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:40.62,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:42.80,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.88,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:56.63,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You're a mysterious person, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:58.30,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Hey, Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:02.24,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Will you meet with me again, \Nlike this, a year from now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:03.89,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:11.57,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Focus on moving forward for one \Nwhole year, then meet with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:13.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Can you promise you'll do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.68,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:18.78,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But by then, what if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.42,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What if our classes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:25.44,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There are words I want to say to you now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:28.42,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,and I promise that I'll say them to you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.89,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I promise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:32.92,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'll spend this year \Nfighting with all I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:35.73,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,And I'll aim for Class A!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:38.72,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The future isn't certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.93,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:43.75,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If Ichinose ever seems \Nabout to fall into ruin...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:48.37,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll deal the killing blow.
