Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:58.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Being here takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:09:59.96,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Forget that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:03.01,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,What's with this message from Hiyori,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.46,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\shad0\bord0\c&H847E4A&\pos(263.333,24.667)}Shiina Hiyori
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.46,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\shad0\bord0\c&HDDD9CC&\pos(248,52.667)}Ryuen Kakeru
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.46,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&HDDD9CC&\pos(310.667,79.333)}A message for Ryuen-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.46,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&HA19389&\b1\pos(186.667,189.333)}This is from Ayanokoji-kun.\N\N"I could have more easily and safely won\Nfive matches in the special exam."\N\NFor the rest, please talk to Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.91,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.71,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It means just what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:10.34,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You could've done it better and safer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:16.34,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd be sad if you messed up \Nand had to leave the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:21.85,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Big words from the man \Nwho lost to Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.66,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I did lose, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:27.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,And as I was the team captain, \NI can't make excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.63,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Yeah? Don't give me that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:34.86,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You beat me, so you could've beat Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:38.24,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Were you just not even trying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:42.50,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Or maybe there was something \Nbeyond your control...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:43.84,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:50.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:53.84,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Enjoy my time off, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.51,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,And once I get tired of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:59.24,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,I think I'll warm up by crushing \NIchinose and Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:03.38,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,And if anyone's going to expel you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:06.18,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,It's going to be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:13.40,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:16.67,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,That's the best a surprise attack gets me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You do have potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:24.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Try to mature more effectively, Ryuen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:27.87,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Since when did you become my teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:34.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If Class B had found proof of what \Nyou did, you'd have been screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:39.55,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you stay at your current level, \Nwe'll never have a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:43.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Don't leave obvious tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:48.48,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Under the circumstances, \NI'll take your shitty advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:51.93,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,But one day, I {\i1}will{\i0} crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:57.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind being crushed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:02.44,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,You're going on lots of dates \Nwith Ike-kun lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:05.70,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not like that with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:08.02,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,You don't have to deny it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.46,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,I'm curious, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:11.56,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,I told you, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.39,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.39,0:12:14.96,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,You're blushing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:17.16,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,You're red all the way to your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.16,0:12:19.22,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Seriously, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:20.69,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:23.21,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Want me to buy you a crêpe after this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.97,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Sorry, got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.27,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I'm taking off early! See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:28.48,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:32.04,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Karuizawa-san seemed a little down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:34.24,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Did something happen to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:36.32,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Speaking of, Sato-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:38.48,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,how did things go with Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:39.04,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:40.21,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:42.99,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,You were thinking about \Nhow to ask him out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.25,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Promise you won't tell anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.45,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Of course we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:48.82,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:50.72,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:55.50,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,What? He turned you down like {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.62,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,K-Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:13:00.48,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,What is he, stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:05.51,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,I think... Ayanokoji-kun likes Karuizawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.85,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,F-For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:08.89,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:15.65,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,And I think Karuizawa-san \Nmight like Ayanokoji-kun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:19.15,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,I'm trying to forget, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:24.66,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,I always thought Karuizawa-san \Nhad higher standards, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:29.62,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,But... Ayanokoji-kun's a quality guy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.70,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Really? He's just a fast runner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:36.19,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... it's more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What did you call me out here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.66,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:48.12,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,What would you think of returning to \Nyour father after this spring break?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:51.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No. I like this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:58.26,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your life here might \Njust get harder if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.82,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,Why don't we have a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:07.58,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,A student from the White Room will \Nbe mixed in with the incoming class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:14.08,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,If you can ascertain which student it is \Nby the end of April, I will withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:18.30,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You're not the only success we've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:21.09,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,That student will be the \None to put an end to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:22.62,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:27.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But there is one thing that \NI can say with confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:33.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There is no one from the White \NRoom who is superior to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:38.04,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,Those eerie eyes with such \Ndarkness within them...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:40.96,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,You're the spitting image of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.34,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:52.46,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Can I help you with something, Matsushita?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:57.25,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Were you talking to the \Nchairman about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:15:00.15,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Apparently they want to remodel this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:03.01,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,I happened to be here, \Nso he asked my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:05.79,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:15.64,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Hey, you gave the right answer during \Nthat mental math test, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.15,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,90)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord0}Q10
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:22.40,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That subject just happens \Nto be one I'm good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:27.90,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,I saw you and Hirata-kun \Ntalking on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:37.83,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Hirata-kun's recovery didn't \Njust happen, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:43.18,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun, you're better at academics \Nand sports than you admit to, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:46.96,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I hold back because I \Ndon't want to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:50.13,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Then please contribute more \Nto the class from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:54.35,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,I want to reach Class A, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:57.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd recently been thinking \Nof doing that, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:01.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But don't get your hopes up too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:05.36,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm already using 70 to 80 \Npercent of what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:06.96,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.72,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,And... can I ask you one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.37,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HC2A593&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H785C4A&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(362.666,192.667)}Place a call to this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.37,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HBD9C8B&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H5C462E&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(322.667,231.333)}Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.37,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H62524A&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H3D2D27&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(408.667,223.333)}Call
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:19.87,Flashback,Matsushita,0,0,0,,I want to ask you about Karuizawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:25.63,Flashback,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Does she like you because she \Nknows what you can really do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.38,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's not why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:30.68,Flashback,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Then what is your relationship, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.01,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HC2A593&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H785C4A&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(362.666,192.667)}Place a call to this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.01,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HBD9C8B&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H5C462E&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(322.667,231.333)}Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.01,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H62524A&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H3D2D27&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(408.667,223.333)}Call
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:44.02,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Since we're going for Class A, would you \Nbe willing to unleash your full ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:45.96,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:47.15,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:52.05,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's no one in our \Nclass year who can compete with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:54.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There's no point in me going all-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.75,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Let's put that to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:58.53,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:04.29,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,How about competing with me in \Nour second-year written exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:10.30,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\fay.1\fax-.2\bo4rd0\shad0\frx2\fry356\3c&H2D2F2F&\c&HC4C7BE&\frz356.1\pos(379.333,71.334)}Ayanokoji Kiyotaka
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:10.30,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If I win, you join the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:14.50,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Could I ask why you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.81,0:17:17.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:19.58,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't care for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.94,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,In exchange, if I win,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:25.82,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,you have to go all-out from then on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:27.51,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:29.32,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.32,0:17:30.21,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.95,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HC2A593&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H785C4A&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(345.999,196.667)}Place a call to this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.95,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HBD9C8B&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H5C462E&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(299.334,239.333)}Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.95,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H62524A&\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&H3D2D27&\frz6.071\fax.1\pos(392,231.333)}Call
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:18:59.99,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:03.42,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Did you remember what you wanted to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:04.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:09.20,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Like I said earlier, I've got \Ndinner with friends at seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.52,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:12.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:17.51,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,This is creepy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:21.51,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You've been totally \Nwishy-washy since the café.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:23.28,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:27.27,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,And Sato-san is starting \Nto ask questions about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:32.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Matsushita is asking questions about us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.08,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:37.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Matsushita's begun to \Nsuspect my real abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:43.66,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,She seems like the type to hide her \Nown exceptional traits, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:45.63,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,H-Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.96,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I can't keep up with all \Nthis new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.92,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It feels like this is going \Nin a really bad direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:56.92,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't think we have to worry \Nabout Sato and Matsushita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:59.22,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,No, we totally do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:04.18,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,If this gets around, \Nit's going to mess up all my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:09.68,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Even if I want to get a new boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:14.17,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,no one's going to ask me out if they \Nthink I'm already with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.80,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I broke up with Hirata-kun, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.94,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So I'm looking for a new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:23.15,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:28.95,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I mean, you're getting \Nclose to Shiina-san, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:32.26,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,And you've got stuff in \Ncommon with her, unlike me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:38.58,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.36,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Kei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:41.59,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:46.92,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Feel free to ignore this \Nif you don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:50.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Will you date me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:51.76,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:56.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm asking if you'd be willing to date me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:20:59.36,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Um, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:01.88,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I don't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:07.26,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,what you're... talking... about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.61,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Wait, huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.61,0:21:12.74,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Y-You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:14.61,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I thought you liked Shiina-san—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:19.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I just did that to see if \Nyou'd get jealous, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:21.20,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,S-So? What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:23.39,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing this up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:29.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wanted to prevent you from \Nbecoming someone else's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:33.46,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So... Does that mean you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.90,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You {\i1}like{\i0} me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:44.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes. I like you, Karuizawa Kei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:54.26,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I... I'm willing to date you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:58.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Does that mean you like me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.23,0:22:01.94,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Y-You're going to make me say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:06.73,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,W-Well... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:12.44,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I guess I... might like you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:14.81,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,As much as I hate to admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:17.18,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:21.76,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,A-Are you gonna kiss me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:23.88,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.48,0:22:25.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:27.36,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,N-Not {\i1}yet{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.31,0:22:31.24,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,This is enough for now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:36.68,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Yeah... for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:44.03,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey. Have you gotten a little taller?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:46.32,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Maybe I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:52.20,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Humans are creatures that learn and grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.59,0:22:57.10,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,This romance is necessary \Nfor Karuizawa Kei to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:02.48,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,At the same time, I'll use \NKei to learn about romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:06.74,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's something I couldn't \Nlearn about in the White Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.97,0:23:10.95,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But once I'm done reading \Nthe textbook known as Kei,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:13.25,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I won't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.17,0:23:15.36,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:19.64,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll find myself in a future \Nwhere that's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:23.26,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Let's pray...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.49,0:23:32.06,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,that in this moment, \Nholding someone precious in my arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:35.25,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,that I'm smiling.
